<title>ITALY: ALPINE SKIING-MEN'S DOWNHILL TRAINING TIMES.</title>
<headline>ALPINE SKIING-MEN'S DOWNHILL TRAINING TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>VAL GARDENA, Italy 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading unofficial</p>
<p>times in Wednesday's first training run for Alpine skiing men's</p>
<p>World Cup downhills on Friday and Saturday (&quot;Saslong&quot; piste:</p>
<p>3,446 metres, vertical drop 839 metres):</p>
<p> 1. Fritz Strobl (Austria)	one minute 59.82 seconds</p>
<p> 2 equal. Kristian Ghedina (Italy)	 2:00.68</p>
<p> 2 equal. Josef Strobl (Austria)	   2:00.68</p>
<p> 4. Franco Cavegn (Switzerland)	    2:00.78</p>
<p> 5. Werner Franz (Austria)		   2:00.80</p>
<p> 6 equal. Luc Alphand (France)	     2:01.03</p>
<p> 6 equal. Andreas Schifferer (Austria)   2:01.03</p>
<p> 8.Tommy Moe (U.S.)			    2:01.39</p>
<p> 9.Hannes Trinkl (Austria)		   2:01.44</p>
<p> 10.Markus Herrmann (Switzerland)	  2:01.45</p>
</text>
